{"id": 19, "name": "Minotaur", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1d1c6132b7cb0a2031972d45029967db.png", "cls": ["Tank", "Support"], "specialty": ["Crowd Control", ""], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["100", "10", "80", "40"], "lanes": ["Roam", ""], "story": "Minoan prince determined to restore his homeland.", "skills": [{"name": "Rage Incarnate", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4296561c81f79f3960c72c6d707a2f86.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "After casting a skill, Minotaur gains <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Motivation</span>, recovering HP equal to 5 (+1*Hero Level)% of damage taken from enemy heroes for 3s.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Enraged State</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Motivation</span> HP recovery is increased to 200%."}, {"name": "Despair Stomp", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_a902b3f75e08b180503d02796804baae.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12", "desc": "Minotaur jumps to the target location, dealing 280<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in the area and briefly knocking them airborne. Enemies hit will also be slowed by 40% while Minotaur enhances his Basic Attacks to deal <span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+3% Total HP)</span> extra <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> for 2s.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Enraged</span>: Increases the AOE range and the damage dealt by <span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+3% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Motivation Roar", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_72ead6458b2fd5fa001d4cc594ee37a8.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 51,